{
  "uid": "operacion-sa-p10",
  "title": "Operación SA P10",
  "description": "Tablero de operación de la tienda (P10): los SLO arriba y las 4 señales de oro debajo. Cada fila responde una pregunta.",
  "tags": [
    "p10",
    "slo",
    "senales-de-oro"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Runbooks",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "icon": "doc",
      "url": "https://github.com/Joe1172003/Practicas-SA-B-202200271/tree/main/P10/runbooks"
    },
    {
      "title": "Definición de los SLO",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "icon": "info",
      "url": "https://github.com/Joe1172003/Practicas-SA-B-202200271/blob/main/P10/slo/definicion-slo.md"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "¿Estamos cumpliendo lo que prometimos a los clientes? (últimos 7 días)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilidad esta semana",
      "description": "SLO 1. Qué fracción de las peticiones de los clientes salió sin error del servidor en los últimos 7 días. Prometido: 99.5 %. Verde = cumpliendo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "slo:disponibilidad_sli:ratio_rate7d",
          "legendFormat": "Sin errores (prometido 99.5 %)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.995
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Catálogo rápido esta semana",
      "description": "SLO 2. Qué fracción de las consultas al catálogo respondió en menos de 500 ms en los últimos 7 días. Prometido: 99 %.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "slo:catalogo_sli:ratio_rate7d",
          "legendFormat": "En menos de 500 ms (prometido 99 %)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Presupuesto de error",
      "description": "Cuánto queda del margen de fallas de la semana. 100 % = no se gastó nada; 0 % = la promesa de la semana se rompió. Baja con cada falla y se recupera solo a medida que las fallas salen de la ventana de 7 días.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - slo:disponibilidad_presupuesto_consumido:ratio",
          "legendFormat": "Disponibilidad"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "1 - slo:catalogo_presupuesto_consumido:ratio",
          "legendFormat": "Catálogo rápido"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alertas sonando ahora",
      "description": "Alertas de los SLO y del stack en estado firing. Cada una llega por correo con su runbook.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", severity!=\"prueba\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Alertas"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Tráfico: ¿cuánta gente está usando la tienda?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tráfico por servicio",
      "description": "Peticiones por segundo que atiende cada servicio (sin /health). El gateway es la puerta: es lo que piden los clientes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Órdenes por minuto",
      "description": "Métrica de negocio. Órdenes que llegan a cada estado y las rechazadas por causa. Si \"creada\" cae a 0 con tráfico normal, nadie está pudiendo comprar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (estado) (rate(ordenes_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{estado}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum by (causa) (rate(ordenes_rechazadas_total[5m])) * 60) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "rechazada {{causa}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ventas últimas 24 h (Q)",
      "description": "Métrica de negocio. Quetzales de las órdenes pagadas en las últimas 24 horas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(ventas_quetzales_total[24h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Q"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Errores: ¿qué está fallando y dónde?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores por servicio",
      "description": "Porcentaje de respuestas 5xx de cada servicio. Si solo sube el gateway, el problema está en lo que el gateway llama. Clic en una línea -> trazas con error de ese servicio en Tempo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or (sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m])) * 0)) / sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.072
              }
            ]
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Ver trazas con error de este servicio en Tempo",
              "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes=%7B%22t%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22limit%22%3A20%2C%22tableType%22%3A%22traces%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%7B%20resource.service.name%20%3D%20%5C%22${__field.labels.job:percentencode}%5C%22%20%26%26%20status%20%3D%20error%20%7D%22%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22${__from}%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22${__to}%22%7D%7D%7D"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Respuestas del gateway por código",
      "description": "Lo que reciben los clientes: 2xx bien, 4xx error del cliente (por ejemplo, sesión vencida), 5xx error nuestro.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"gateway\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
